# False-positive decomposition, six-tumor current models (ver4, 2026-11-23)

chr1, benchmark regions, PASS calls, seed 0. GRCh38-only = six-tumor model without population site features as a model input (m4m6_graphs_20261110/multicancer6_<P>_<KIND>_linear_nositef); HPRC v2.1 = six-tumor current model (SNV snv_newpipe_20261109/multicancer6_<P>_SNV_newpipe, INDEL release_s0_<P>_INDEL). Share = % of the GRCh38-graph FP alleles; candidates retained = % of the alleles of that class with a tensor in the v2.1 test set of the same reads. In the HPRC v2.1 graph = carried by >= 46 of 463 HPRC v2.1 haplotypes.

